          "worked": "The even factors give $16!!=2^8\\times8!$, and the odd and even factors together give $15!!\\times16!!=16!$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{15!!}{16!!}&=\\frac{16!}{(16!!)^2}\\\\\\frac{15!!}{16!!}&=\\frac{16!}{(2^8\\times8!)^2}\\\\\\frac{15!!}{16!!}&=\\frac{1}{4^8}\\binom{16}{8}\\\\\\frac{15!!}{16!!}&=\\frac{12\\,870}{65\\,536}\\\\\\frac{15!!}{16!!}&=\\frac{6435}{32\\,768}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
